---
# Placebo Engine Framework — LLVM style, two-space indent, 100-column lines.
# The rest is stock LLVM. Two deliberate, documented deviations:
#   - ColumnLimit 100 instead of 80: witness thunks read better with room to breathe.
#   - PointerAlignment Left: the codebase is function-pointer-shaped, and
#     `Ret* (*)(Args...)` beats `Ret* (* )(Args...)` in every audit we ran.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Left
DerivePointerAlignment: false
InsertNewlineAtEOF: true
